---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/CTASection.astro';
import StatsBar from '../components/StatsBar.astro';
import RelatedCaseStudies from '../components/RelatedCaseStudies.astro';
import DMDivider from '../components/DMDivider.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const allCaseStudies = (await getCollection('case-studies')).map(p => ({
  slug: p.id,
  title: p.data.title,
  client: p.data.client,
  industry: p.data.industry,
  description: p.data.description,
  tags: p.data.tags,
})).slice(0, 3);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Byte Digital | Christchurch Web Design Agency"
  description="Learn about Byte Digital — Christchurch's premium web design and digital marketing agency. Our mission, values, and the technology we use to help local businesses dominate online."
>
  <PageHero
    label="About Us"
    title="We build digital engines<br />for <span class='gradient-text'>Christchurch businesses.</span>"
    subtitle="Byte Digital is a Christchurch-based web design and digital marketing agency on a mission to help local businesses dominate online. We combine cutting-edge technology with deep understanding of the New Zealand market."
    breadcrumbs={[
      { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
      { label: 'About' },
    ]}
    dotMatrix={true}
    dmId="dm-about-hero"
  />

  <section class="section section-glow dm-edge-top">
    <div class="glow-orb purple top-left"></div>
    <div class="glow-orb mint bottom-right"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="service-content" style="position:relative;z-index:1">
        <div class="section-label">Our Story</div>
        <h2 class="heading-accent">Built for Christchurch, powered by technology.</h2>
        <p>Byte Digital was born from a frustration that every Christchurch business owner knows too well. You pay good money for a website, and what do you get? A slow, generic WordPress site that looks like every other website in your industry, ranks nowhere on Google, and generates approximately zero new customers. Meanwhile, your competitors — the ones with the flashy websites and the top Google rankings — are taking the clients that should be yours.</p>
        <p>We saw this happening to businesses across Christchurch and Canterbury every day. Roofers with 20 years of experience losing jobs to newcomers with better websites. Dental practices with world-class clinical skills invisible online while clinics with inferior services dominated search results. Pool companies, electricians, hair salons, tradies of every kind — all being held back not by the quality of their work, but by the quality of their digital presence.</p>
        <p>The web design industry in New Zealand had a problem. Most agencies were still building WordPress sites with bloated plugins, page builders, and template themes that produced mediocre results. They charged premium prices for work that was fundamentally outdated, and their clients paid the price in poor performance, low search rankings, and missed opportunities. We knew there had to be a better way.</p>
        <p>So we built Byte Digital to be the agency we wished existed when we were business owners ourselves. An agency that uses genuinely modern technology. An agency that measures success by leads generated and revenue increased, not just by how pretty a website looks. An agency that understands the Christchurch market intimately — the suburbs, the seasons, the search behaviour, the local competition. An agency that treats your business growth as its own.</p>
        <p>We are not a large, impersonal agency that hands your project off to a junior developer. We are a focused team of web designers, developers, and digital strategists who work directly with you. When you work with Byte Digital, you work with the same people from your first consultation through to your ongoing optimisation. No account managers passing messages. No overseas call centres. Just direct, honest communication with people who genuinely care about your results.</p>
        <p>Every industry we serve teaches us something new about what Christchurch and Canterbury businesses need from their digital presence. That cumulative knowledge feeds back into every project we take on, which means you benefit not just from our expertise, but from insights across many local industries. We are not just building websites — we are building a deep, proprietary understanding of the New Zealand digital landscape that no generic agency can match.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <StatsBar />

  <section class="section reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="founder-intro-card glass">
        <div class="founder-intro-grid">
          <div class="founder-intro-image">
            <img src="/images/founder.jpg" alt="Barry Grottis, Founder & Lead Developer of Byte Digital" />
            <div class="founder-intro-glow"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="founder-intro-content">
            <div class="founder-intro-label">Meet the Founder</div>
            <h3 class="founder-intro-name">Barry Grottis</h3>
            <p class="founder-intro-subtitle">Founder & Lead Developer</p>
            <p class="founder-intro-text">
              I've been crafting websites since 2011, which means I've seen the web evolve from simple static pages to the AI-powered, automation-driven landscape we work in today. Over those 14+ years, I've mastered not just web design and development, but the entire digital ecosystem: search engine optimization (SEO), the emerging field of Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) for AI-driven search, and building custom software solutions that automate business processes and drive real results.
            </p>
            <p class="founder-intro-text">
              What drives me? Helping local businesses like yours step confidently into the digital age. I believe every Christchurch business deserves a website that works as hard as they do — one that ranks, converts, and grows with them. Beyond the screen, I'm a family man who values staying active and experiencing life (usually involving good food). When you work with Byte Digital, you work directly with me. No middlemen, no outsourcing — just dedicated expertise and honest communication.
            </p>
            <div class="founder-intro-badges">
              <span class="founder-intro-badge">14+ Years Experience</span>
              <span class="founder-intro-badge">Web Design & Development</span>
              <span class="founder-intro-badge">AI Automation</span>
              <span class="founder-intro-badge">SEO & GEO</span>
              <span class="founder-intro-badge">Custom Software</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <DMDivider id="dm-about-values" />

  <section class="section reveal" style="background:var(--bg-dark)">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px">
        <div class="section-label">Our Values</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin:0 auto">What drives us.</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:24px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto">
        <div class="glass" style="padding:32px;border-radius:28px">
          <div class="svc-row-icon purple" style="margin-bottom:16px">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px">Results-Driven</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7">
            A beautiful website that generates no leads is an expensive decoration. We measure our success by the tangible impact on your business — more enquiries, more bookings, more revenue. Every design decision, every line of code, and every SEO strategy is evaluated against a single question: will this help you get more customers? If the answer is no, it doesn't make the cut.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass" style="padding:32px;border-radius:28px">
          <div class="svc-row-icon mint" style="margin-bottom:16px">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px">Transparency</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7">
            No hidden fees, no confusing jargon, no inflated metrics. We tell you exactly what we are doing, why we are doing it, and what results to expect. You get full access to your analytics, ranking reports, and performance data. If something is not working, we will tell you straight away and fix it. We treat every partnership as built on trust and mutual accountability.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="glass" style="padding:32px;border-radius:28px">
          <div class="svc-row-icon purple" style="margin-bottom:16px">
            <svg width="28" height="28" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px">Innovation</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.7">
            The web moves fast, and we move faster. We adopt new technologies early, test them rigorously,
